      "claim_id": "charge_transfer_rate_spectrum",
      "statement": "The transfer rate spectrum as a function of donor-acceptor energy gap shows two regimes: at small gaps (Delta E < 2 omega) rates increase monotonically and are proportional to dissipation rate; at larger gaps (Delta E > 2 omega) resonant peaks appear at Delta E = l omega for l=3,4, and rates diminish for Delta E > 4 omega.",
